/-! # SG 2025: customs import duties (OECD 5123; kernel 2.8.0 `TariffRule`; generated by customs/tools/apply.py from customs/packs/sg.json)

customs tariff of Singapore as notified to the WTO IDB for 2025; WTO Integrated Database (IDB), applied tariff notified by Singapore for 2025 (HS 2022), read on the WTO Tariff & Trade Data browse pages (ttd.wto.org/en/data/idb/applied-duties?member=C702&product=<line>&year=2025, retrieved 2026-11-21; customs/packs/sg.json)

* SG: 21 tariff lines and 1 preference groups from the member's IDB notification for 2025; each preference group gives a partner its lowest notified rate per line (the kernel takes the first preference listing the origin)
* origin not given: MFN (the model's convention, `mfnIfOriginUnknown`)
* grade B: official intergovernmental data (WTO IDB, notified by the member); the national tariff instrument is not read

Not modelled (grade C or noted):
* only the HS subheadings of customs/HS_MAP.md are modelled (any other code: grade C, no tariff line)
* IDB notification year 2025: a change of the tariff during 2025 (budget measures, stays of application) is not dated
* national import levies and charges outside the customs duty column (statistical, processing, ECOWAS/AU levies, import VAT advance) not modelled
* the price is taken before VAT and duty only: an excise inside the price needs "customsValue"
* lines left out (grade C): 22030011 (MFN duty 'S$16.00 per litre of alcohol': specific or compound duty, unit/currency not mapp); 22030019 (MFN duty 'S$16.00 per litre of alcohol': specific or compound duty, unit/currency not mapp); 22030091 (MFN duty 'S$16.00 per litre of alcohol': specific or compound duty, unit/currency not mapp); 22030099 (MFN duty 'S$16.00 per litre of alcohol': specific or compound duty, unit/currency not mapp)
* ASEAN free trade area (ATIGA) (origin BN, KH, ID, LA, MY, MM, PH, TH, VN): internal preference not in the member's 2025 IDB notification, rate not read (grade C)
-/

